  "Id": 110,
  "Title": "AKU tops HEC ranking for medical universities in 2015",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "AKU has maintained its position as the top medical university in Pakistan for the fifth time in a row in HEC ranking",
  "GlobalNews": true,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>The Aga Khan University has been ranked as the top medical university in Pakistan in the <a href=\"http://hec.gov.pk/english/universities/Documents/Ranking_Doc%20%282015%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">ranking of Pakistani universities in 2015</a>, released by the Higher Education Commission - the primary regulatory body of higher education in the country.</p><p>AKU was also ranked as the top private university and fifth of 129 public and private universities in different categories - including general, engineering and technology, business education, agriculture and veterinary, medicine, and arts and design.<br/></p><p>Dr Mukhtar Ahmed, Chairman, HEC unveiled the ranking on February 23 in Islamabad.</p><p>In the medical category, AKU was ranked as the best of 13 universities, including University of Health Sciences, Dow University of Health Sciences and Khyber Medical University.</p><p>The parameters considered in a comprehensive selection process included quality assurance, teaching quality, research, finance and facilities, and social integration or community development.</p><p><p>More details: <a href=\"https://www.dawn.com/news/1241418\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dawn.com/news/1241418</a></p><p><em>News amended</em><br/></p></p>",
